        "input": "4\n3\n1 2 2\n4\n0 6 -3 3\n5\n1 2 3 2 1\n6\n8 7 6 5 4 10",
        "output": "-1\n1\n0\n2",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111: We can't convert the array AAA into a palindrome.\nTest case 222: We do the following operation:\n\nChoose i=2i = 2i=2, X=−3X = -3X=−3. The array AAA becomes [3,0,0,3][3, 0, 0, 3][3,0,0,3].\nThis is a palindrome.\n\nTest case 333: The array AAA is already a palindrome, so no operations are needed."
